{"parse": {"title": "漫漫之夜行迹-05", "pageid": 56394, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-04\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">漫漫之夜行迹-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-06\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AB.A5.E8.AF.9D.E4.B9.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"童话书\">童话书</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 童话书</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>证明是需要时间的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐仍未彻底地得到属于自己的答案。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>天上的声音如是说，有件大事将要发生在你身上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从林中砍伐树木，又从树木中裁切木板，再从木板中刨拨木棍与卯口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船的轮廓便已存在了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>于是，他终其一生地等待一个奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>直至死亡到来，一切仍未发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船意味着旅途的开始，它能够承载人与货物，跨越水域，遇见新世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们呼喊着，互相沟通，选定了方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>那人缠绵病榻时，又对天上的声音询问，那件大事在何时发生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>推动，推动，紧接着推动。沙地上留下清晰的沟壑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>请进来吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闭关处的门口出现一道身影，他走进桌案，放下餐盘，却不就坐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>真稀奇，你居然有兴致与人聊天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们的关系不友好，210的态度如同炸开了背毛的雄猫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐低下头，翻动书页，又用头冠压住书本，才抬起头来看向他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>这与我的主观意识无关。和37一样，你特地前来，一定是有话要说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>既然确定如此，直接询问更为快捷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>船已经起航了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>很多人都在那艘船上，我们熟悉的人，看着我们长大的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>负责烹饪食物的人，负责精算的人，负责勘误的人……苏菲亚的父亲，与6……他们都在船上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于一座得以避免“流溢”的小岛来说，向雨幕的探索无疑聚集着数之不尽的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这注定是一场伟大的旅行，人们确认，再确认，以生命作为抵押才能坐上拓展眼界与寻觅真理的桌案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>苏菲亚已经对我说过，他们的船竣工了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无窗且窄门的闭关处与外界隔绝，热火朝天的探索运动并未波及亚齐的计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他不曾出门观看新生的一切，就好像这座岛的壮举与他毫无干系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>成堆的书本被挪动了位置，向着外层扩散，而接近他的内圈又摆放上了新的书籍，如同一滴水落下后，水面鼓起的涟漪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你不打算去送行吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我尚在闭关中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你从不打算履行自己的义务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>或许是那既定的命运让你从此与众不同了，也或许，是另一位6的光芒使你自惭形秽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>积怨使话语变得锋利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的人跟随憧憬，产生崇敬，而后，他开始接触妒忌——不甘、怀疑与怨怼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他开始质问自己，也无声地质问命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>我不免怀疑，你是否真的能做好6的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>你对6……我是指艾尔玛，你对她的尊敬蒙蔽了你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>你并非出自本心提出质疑，你的心里有情感，它们蒙蔽了你的判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>书页又翻新章节，熟悉的故事跃然眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>6只是6，一个数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>你应该多听听37所说的话。它被世人严重地高估了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一篇寓言，讲述着熟悉的故事。<br />这是亚齐今天第三次读到它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……这个话题应该结束了，你想传达的信息已经带到，我们应该回到各自的工作中去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>回去吧，210。我不想与你争论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个金色的头顶让人恼火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>我的朋友，你在看什么书？是什么样的著作拨动了您的心弦，让您沉湎其中，以至于忽略掉美好的亲情？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>动作与谦逊的语气背道而驰，他伸手，果决地抽出了那本被过分关注的书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210的呼吸变得深而慢，他的心如同放在炉子上的饼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一册绘本。《来自于天上的声音》，它如此令人感到熟悉，如此普遍。岛屿上的每个孩子都曾听过这个故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>这就是你在忙的事……就是看这些、这些孩子所看的书？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>不止于此，但确实包括它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐语气平静，像在阐述一件理所当然的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>一本……儿童寓言……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出于愤怒，青年人向前倾斜身体，手掌握拳，压在桌面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>看来6的使命真的让你发了疯，注定降临的智慧与才能给了你挥霍的勇气……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>是啊，无论如何，你终究会成为6的，终究会获得那顶桂冠上的一切馈赠！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你将你的亲人看得不如一本儿童寓言，你将你的友邻视为模糊的他者……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>一份祝福，降临在了最不该领取它的人身上——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210的声音哽在喉头，紧接着，如同被迎面泼下一盆水的火焰似的，嗤的一声黯淡下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你的心中并无智慧，脑中更无关爱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他直起身子，用手掌挡住双眼，遮盖自己的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>……我可以预见，你只会让学派探寻的智慧停滞不前！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>进步是相对的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚齐从书本之中抬起头，也抬起一双蓝色的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>那么我请问你，朋友。如果我们追求的智慧，会造成我们自身的覆灭，你又会如何选择？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>……你这是什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>你在暗示我们向岛外探寻的决策是错误的吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我并没有那个意思……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对话的错位造成了误解，210身上的怒气几乎变得有形且可触碰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我只是在思考……不，就当我什么都没说过吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怨恨已经无可弥合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>……很好，保持着你的观点吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210离去的脚步声与亚齐平静的叙述相互交杂，最终，一起落入猛地摔上木门的响声中。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "漫漫之夜行迹-05"}}